{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0282_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0282_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ccef02c1c9f6e9b9135f95de9428075cd864abe43705f98a152bf3a8e927f131", "ja": "エレナ、今日は撮影お疲れさま！\n……空なんか見上げて、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "艾丽娜，今天辛苦拍摄了！\n……怎么抬头望着天空，是有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0282_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0282_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "82e3937716021e07156a2b1b86e9dbefb32826ed1b008a79a7c866eca5f1dbe6", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}。\n今、星を見てたんだヨ。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。\n我刚才在看星星哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
