{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0282_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0282_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "ab11d693e2bbf4def2e11a1264d2beb24f49eb9204abf9b8676a9e7b22975bb4", "ja": "うん。星って、ここからじゃわからないけど……\n本当はひとつひとつ、大きさも色も違うんだよネ？", "zh": "嗯。虽然从这里看不出来，但星星其实每一颗的大小和颜色都不一样，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0282_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0282_1004_018ele", "source_sha256": "b80f7ac2d0ed3be544033754955bdb4c2fad75743fcb459b55177b46759bd86a", "ja": "それってなんだか、アイドルみたい、って\n思ったんだヨー。", "zh": "我觉得，那就像偶像一样呢——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0282_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0282_1005_p", "source_sha256": "6998fa4c3bee148da05df3f608d53ac859c4bd81167a99bff4aaa56492f21ac5", "ja": "なるほど。\nじゃあエレナも、あの星のひとつって事だな。", "zh": "原来如此。\n那么，艾蕾娜也是那颗星星中的一颗了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0282_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0282_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "5eac9464583797c263ba086924f8a6136573f7947ab0cf8713599f02a7099256", "ja": "それならワタシ、お星さまみたいにもっと輝かないと！\nワタシを見たみんなが、笑顔になれるようにネっ♪", "zh": "既然这样，我也要像星星一样，绽放出更加耀眼的光芒才行！\n要让看到我的大家，都能露出笑容哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
